abstract: >-
  A protocol-first, evidence-grounded multi-agent skill for producing auditable
  geography and environmental-science review manuscripts, including source-plan
  validation, design-matched appraisal, geographic heterogeneity analysis,
  claim-level certainty, verified citations, and publication-readiness audits.
